  {
    "id": 1019003040010,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──あれ、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "3000190030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "056",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……おう、すまん\r\n邪魔しちゃったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040020,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ううん、大丈夫……\r\n今、写真撮ってた？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\n練習風景、自分じゃ撮るの難しいだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ダンスレッスンをしてる真剣な姿、\r\nアップしたら喜ばれるんじゃないかと思ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……そっか、サンキュ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040040,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いい写真あったら\r\nうちのスマホに送っておいてよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あとでツイスタに載せたいからさ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "けど、ダンスもまだまだだから\r\nいいカンジなのは写真だけか～ってなるかも",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "てか、そうならないようにしなきゃ\r\nなんだけどね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──ひとりでも、勝たないと……だから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………愛依はさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他人のいいところを見つけるのは\r\nすごく上手なのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分のことになると、\r\nそれが急に難しくなるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え……そうかな？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもあさひや冬優子のこと、褒めてるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……だって、\r\nふたりは本当にすごいじゃん？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "今回、ひとりで色々やってみて\r\nますますそう思ったっていうか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依だって、すごいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ううん、うちなんか…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルになってから競争してばっかりだって、\r\n愛依、言っただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ……\r\nあれは──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かにこういうオーディションや、\r\n順位がつくようなアイドル選挙が",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良い側面だけを持ったものだとは思わない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけどさ、証明にはなるかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『愛依はすごいんだ』って、\r\n愛依が自信を持って言うための",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』で\r\nトップのアイドル──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんな肩書なくたって、\r\n愛依がすごいってこと、ちゃんと知ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、周りのみんなも、\r\nファンのみんなも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、愛依は『うちなんか』って言うからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから俺は、愛依に\r\n『G.R.A.D.』で優勝してほしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040170,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "愛依はすごいんだって\r\n愛依自身に証明したいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040180,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……うち、\r\nひとりでも、勝たなきゃって思って",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040190,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "けど、いつもみたいに隣にふたりがいて\r\nユニットとして競い合ってるわけでもないのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040200,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "なんのためにって、\r\nどっかで思ってたのかも",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040210,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040220,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──うち、『G.R.A.D.』で優勝したい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1019003040230,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うちと、プロデューサーと、周りのみんなと、\r\nファンのみんなのために",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101900304/1019003040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ああ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "もう少しだけ\r\n練習していくか",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "よし\r\n送っていくよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
